IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BPXSPI.

*> Local SPI test double (adapter=FIXTURE).  Deterministic, file-backed so
*> that settlement submissions and unknown outcomes survive restarts and
*> can be queried again.  This is NOT a Banco Central integration.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT SPI-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-SPI-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS SP-KEY OF SP-REC
        FILE STATUS IS WS-SPI-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD SPI-FILE.
01 SP-REC.
   05 SP-KEY           PIC X(36).
   05 SP-RESULT        PIC X(12).
   05 SP-EXT-REF       PIC X(32).
   05 SP-AMOUNT        PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 SP-CURRENCY      PIC X(03).
   05 SP-QUERIES       PIC 9(03).
   05 SP-CREATED       PIC 9(14).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SIM PIC X(12).
01 WS-EXT PIC X(28).
01 WS-SPI-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-SPI-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-KEY PIC X(36).
01 WS-ID PIC X(32).
01 WS-NEW PIC X(01).
01 WS-NOW PIC 9(14).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BPXSP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-PX-SPI-PARMS.
    MOVE SPACES TO SI-RESULT SI-EXT-REF
    IF SI-ADAPTER NOT = "FIXTURE"
        MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
        MOVE "PIX SPI ADAPTER NOT CONFIGURED" TO SI-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(SI-OP) = "STL-SUBMIT"
        PERFORM DO-STL-SUBMIT
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF FUNCTION TRIM(SI-OP) = "STL-QUERY"
        PERFORM DO-STL-QUERY
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM DO-PAYMENT.

DO-PAYMENT.
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(SI-SIM) TO WS-SIM
    IF WS-SIM = SPACES OR WS-SIM = "NONE"
        MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO SI-RESULT
        PERFORM BUILD-REF
        MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
        MOVE "SPI SUBMISSION ACCEPTED" TO SI-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    EVALUATE WS-SIM
        WHEN "ACCEPTED"
            MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SUBMISSION ACCEPTED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "TIMEOUT"
            MOVE "TIMEOUT" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "24" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI TIMEOUT OUTCOME UNKNOWN" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "REJECT"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI REJECTED PAYMENT" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "REJECTED"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI REJECTED PAYMENT" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "FAIL"
            MOVE "FAILED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI PROCESSING FAILURE" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "DUPLICATE"
            MOVE "ACCEPTED" TO SI-RESULT
            PERFORM BUILD-REF
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI DUPLICATE RESPONSE REPLAYED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN SPI SIMULATION" TO SI-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DO-STL-SUBMIT.
    PERFORM OPEN-SPI-I-O
    IF SI-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM READ-KEY
    IF WS-NEW = "N"
        MOVE SP-RESULT OF SP-REC TO SI-RESULT
        MOVE SP-EXT-REF OF SP-REC TO SI-EXT-REF
        MOVE SP-AMOUNT OF SP-REC TO SI-AMOUNT
        CLOSE SPI-FILE
        MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
        MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT REPLAY" TO SI-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(SI-SIM) TO WS-SIM
    IF WS-SIM = SPACES OR WS-SIM = "NONE"
        MOVE "SUBMITTED" TO WS-SIM
    END-IF
    EVALUATE WS-SIM
        WHEN "SUBMITTED"
            MOVE "SUBMITTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT SUBMITTED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "SETTLED"
            MOVE "SETTLED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT CONFIRMED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "TIMEOUT"
            MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "24" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT OUTCOME UNKNOWN" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "UNKNOWN"
            MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "24" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT OUTCOME UNKNOWN" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "REJECT"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT REJECTED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "REJECTED"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT REJECTED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "FAIL"
            MOVE "REJECTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT FAILED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN "DUPLICATE"
            MOVE "SUBMITTED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI DUPLICATE SUBMISSION REPLAYED" TO SI-MSG
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN SPI SIMULATION" TO SI-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    IF SI-RC = "00" OR SI-RC = "24" OR SI-RC = "20"
        PERFORM BUILD-STL-REF
        MOVE SPACES TO SP-REC
        PERFORM BUILD-KEY
        MOVE SI-RESULT TO SP-RESULT
        MOVE SI-EXT-REF TO SP-EXT-REF
        MOVE SI-AMOUNT TO SP-AMOUNT
        MOVE SI-CURRENCY TO SP-CURRENCY
        MOVE 0 TO SP-QUERIES
        MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW
        MOVE WS-NOW TO SP-CREATED
        WRITE SP-REC
        IF WS-SPI-ST NOT = "00"
            CLOSE SPI-FILE
            MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT RECORD FAILED" TO SI-MSG
            GOBACK
        END-IF
    END-IF
    CLOSE SPI-FILE.

DO-STL-QUERY.
    MOVE "Y" TO WS-NEW
    PERFORM OPEN-SPI-I-O
    IF SI-RC NOT = "00"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM READ-KEY
    IF WS-NEW = "Y"
        CLOSE SPI-FILE
        MOVE "UNKNOWN" TO SI-RESULT
        MOVE "24" TO SI-RC
        MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT NOT FOUND" TO SI-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE SP-RESULT OF SP-REC TO SI-RESULT
    MOVE SP-EXT-REF OF SP-REC TO SI-EXT-REF
    MOVE SP-AMOUNT OF SP-REC TO SI-AMOUNT
    IF SP-RESULT = "UNKNOWN"
        ADD 1 TO SP-QUERIES
        IF SP-QUERIES > 1
            MOVE "SETTLED" TO SP-RESULT
            MOVE "SETTLED" TO SI-RESULT
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT RESOLVED" TO SI-MSG
            REWRITE SP-REC
        ELSE
            REWRITE SP-REC
            MOVE "24" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT STILL UNKNOWN" TO SI-MSG
        END-IF
    ELSE
        IF SP-RESULT = "SUBMITTED"
            MOVE "SETTLED" TO SP-RESULT
            MOVE "SETTLED" TO SI-RESULT
            REWRITE SP-REC
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT CONFIRMED" TO SI-MSG
        ELSE
        IF SP-RESULT = "SETTLED"
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT CONFIRMED" TO SI-MSG
            MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
            MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT CONFIRMED" TO SI-MSG
        ELSE
            IF SP-RESULT = "REJECTED"
                MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
                MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT REJECTED" TO SI-MSG
            ELSE
                MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
                MOVE "SPI SETTLEMENT IN FLIGHT" TO SI-MSG
            END-IF
        END-IF
        END-IF
    END-IF
    CLOSE SPI-FILE.

OPEN-SPI-I-O.
    MOVE "00" TO SI-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-SPI-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/pxspis.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-SPI-PATH
    OPEN I-O SPI-FILE
    IF WS-SPI-ST = "35"
        OPEN OUTPUT SPI-FILE
        CLOSE SPI-FILE
        OPEN I-O SPI-FILE
    END-IF
    IF WS-SPI-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO SI-RC
        MOVE "SPI FIXTURE STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO SI-MSG
    END-IF.

BUILD-KEY.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-KEY
    STRING "S" DELIMITED SIZE FUNCTION TRIM(SI-E2E-ID)
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-KEY
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-KEY TO SP-KEY OF SP-REC.

READ-KEY.
    PERFORM BUILD-KEY
    READ SPI-FILE
        INVALID KEY MOVE "Y" TO WS-NEW
        NOT INVALID KEY MOVE "N" TO WS-NEW
    END-READ.

BUILD-STL-REF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXT SI-EXT-REF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-ID
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(SI-E2E-ID) TO WS-ID
    STRING "SPIS-" DELIMITED SIZE WS-ID(2:23) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-EXT
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-EXT TO SI-EXT-REF.

BUILD-REF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-EXT SI-EXT-REF
    STRING "SPI-" DELIMITED SIZE SI-E2E-ID(9:24) DELIMITED SIZE
        INTO WS-EXT
    END-STRING
    MOVE WS-EXT TO SI-EXT-REF.
